OL,3,ANoah Woods left playground through gap
OL,4,Ain fence, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree-year-old Noah Woods, who was
OL,7,Ffound dead in a pond following a huge
OL,8,Fsearch in Suffolk, had left a play area
OL,9,F"through a gap in the fence", an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FA major search was carried out in the
OL,13,Fvillage of Brantham after the toddler
OL,14,Fwent missing on 15 September. His body
OL,15,Fwas found the next day in nearby water
OL,16,Fby police divers.
OL,18,FAssistant coroner Jyoti Gill said it
OL,19,Fwas a "very sad and tragic death" as
OL,20,Fshe opened and adjourned the inquest in
OL,21,FIpswich.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
